{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224120","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1122412001:1":{"text":"듀라 님이시여... 정말 내 물건을 되찾아 왔군요!","source_cn":"艾雅在上……你们真的找回了我的货物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABB2715C9E266ADA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1122412002:1":{"text":"대성통곡은 그만하고, 우린 현상금을 기다리고 있으니 어서 물건이나 확인해 봐.","source_cn":"别光顾着痛哭流涕了，赶紧清点一下，我们还等着领赏金呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08999FA2A4B37282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122412003:1":{"text":"거참, 자세히 확인해 볼 테니 재촉하지 마세요...","source_cn":"哎呀，别急，让我仔细点点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7005A0E2C6E74109","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122412004:1":{"text":"무... 물건을 잃어버리기 전보다 좋은 물건이 꽤 많이 줄었어요! 전체적인 피해가 크지는 않지만...","source_cn":"这……这比丢失之前，少了不少好东西啊！虽然整体损失不大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF1C47A936A50032","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122412005:1":{"text":"도적들 손에 이렇게나 오래 있었는데 모자라지 않는 게 더 이상하지.","source_cn":"这批货在盗匪手里待了这么久，不缺斤少两才怪。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA2F64CD29C52D8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122412006:1":{"text":"단도직입적으로 말하는데 현상금은 골드 반 푼도 못 깎아줘. 아니면 현상금을 한 번 더 걸던가.","source_cn":"但我丑话说在前头，赏金可不能有半个金币的折扣。否则，你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C52E00427D90F4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122412007:1":{"text":"...그, 그러지 마세요! 그런 뜻이 아니에요! 현상으로 내건 현상금은 지불할 겁니다!","source_cn":"——别别别！我没这意思！悬赏令上说的赏金，绝对不会少了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4851933038F19113","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1122412008:1":{"text":"알겠으니 서둘러.","source_cn":"好吧，动作快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD54FE8053CD0F50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:10:1122412008":{"text":"알겠으니 서둘러.","source_cn":"好吧，动作快点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD54FE8053CD0F50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122412009:1":{"text":"기지 건설을 위해서이기도, 너희가 보수를 더 많이 벌어가게끔 하기 위해서이기도 해.","source_cn":"为了基地的建设——也为了让你们多挣点酬金。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2393AE917FDFE79","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122412010:1":{"text":"게다가 이건 그가 약속한 현상금이니 받아내야지.","source_cn":"更何况，是他自己定的悬赏金额，我可不会替他心疼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8251D28AF38D1F47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1122412011:1":{"text":"자요. 확인해 보세요. 1만 골드입니다!","source_cn":"给。你们检查吧，一万枚金币！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69D7D6E9D5226E2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1122412012:1":{"text":"무게는 맞는 것 같네.","source_cn":"重量差不多。算你识相。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08287BBA0122D033","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1122412013:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 와일더, 돈 나눌 준비 해!","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x44864BFEE7E58988","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 와일더, 돈 나눌 준비 해!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 와일더, 돈 나눌 준비 해!","variant_male_record_index":"127129","variant_female_record_index":"127130","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:10:0:1":{"text":"윽...","source_cn":"呃……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF817428D8EC08F63","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"윽...","female":"윽...","variant_male_record_index":"64632","variant_female_record_index":"64633","document_title":"","document_title_